ROKE KHETI THI SAKINA MERE BABA HO KAHAN<br>
QATL KAR-DALEGA MUJHKO YE ANDHERA ZINDAN<br>
<br>
KAMSINE ME HI YATIMI KA MILA HAI SADMA<br>
SHIMR NE MUJHKO TAMACHO SE DIYA HAI PURSA<br>
KUCH TARAS KHAO YATIMA PE SUNO MERI FUGAN<br>
<br>
APNE PYAR SE GHOUHAR MUJHE PHENAYE THE<br>
BADI BE-DARDI SE ZALIM NE USSE CHIL-LIYE<br>
ASHQ AANKHO SE HAI AUR KHOON HAI KAANO SE RAWA<br>
<br>
RATH DIN QAID ME IS TARHA BASAR HOTE HAI<br>
YAAD ME APKI SAB AHLE HARAM ROTE HAI<br>
SHIDDAT-E-GHAM SE NIGAHON ME BHI CHAYA HAI DHUWAN<br>
<br>
DARBADAR HUMKO PHIRAYA HAIN JAFA-KAARON NE<br>
EK HI RASSI ME BANDHA THA SITAMGARON NE<br>
SABKE BAZU PE HAI AUR MERE GALE PAR HAI NASHAN<br>
<br>
MUJHKO TADPATA HAI RHE-RHE KE WO CHERA USKA<br>
MAI JHULATI THI BADE PYAR SE JHULA USKA<br>
LE-CHALO MUJHKO WAHAN PAR MERA ASGHAR HAI KAHAN<br>
<br>
AB THO LAGTA HAI WATAN KO BHI NA JA PAUNGI<br>
QAID KHANE ME HI GHUT GHUT KE MAI MARJAUNGI<br>
MERA MADFAN YAHI BANJAEGA TARIQ MAKAAN<br>
<br>
GHAM KE SAGAR ME HAI GHERAYI AYE JAVED ITNI<br>
ZINDAGI BHAR KOI INSAN KARE KOSHISH JITNI<br>
GHAIR MUMKIN HAI RAQAM KARNA SAKINA KA BAYAAN